<div class="modal fade" id="aptrust_submit_modal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="aptrustSubmitModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="aptrustSubmitModalLabel">Submit collection to APTrust</h1>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>Every Media Object in <strong><%= collection.name %></strong> that is new, or has changed since its last successful APTrust submission, will be preserved in APTrust. Unchanged items that are already preserved are skipped.</p>
        <p>For each item, the descriptive and structural metadata, supplemental files (including captions and transcripts) and master files are sent. Derivatives are not included.</p>
        <p>Master files are restored from Glacier first, which can take several hours. The collection can't be submitted again until this submission finishes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button>
        <%= button_to 'Submit to APTrust', aptrust_admin_collection_path(collection), method: :post, class: 'btn btn-primary',
                      form: { class: 'd-inline' }, data: { testid: 'collection-aptrust-confirm-btn' } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
